* Dashboard Section Order

Top to bottom is the dashboard section order. Move a heading and save:
the dashboard recomposes on save. Add a widget file and it appends
here on the next boot; delete one and its heading prunes. The banner
is structural and always renders first — it never belongs here.
Stock sections are never pruned.

